DETAILED EXPLANATION:
1. `package.json`: Manages project dependencies and scripts for the Node.js backend application.
2. `docker/kali-tor/docker-compose.yml`: Defines the container orchestration for the Kali Linux environment and TOR proxy.
3. `docker/kali-tor/Dockerfile`: Specifies the build instructions for the custom Kali Linux security container.
4. `server/index.js`: Initializes the Express server and middleware for handling API requests.
5. `server/config.js`: Centralizes configuration variables and environment secrets for secure access.
6. `server/services/llm_service.js`: Routes prompts to the appropriate AI provider based on task complexity.
7. `server/services/shodan_service.js`: Interfaces with Shodan API to retrieve vulnerability and host data.
8. `server/services/vpn_service.js`: Manages proxy settings and handles IP rotation logic for anonymity.
9. `server/services/osint_service.js`: Wraps external reconnaissance tools and formats their output for analysis.
10. `server/routes/api.js`: Defines REST endpoints connecting the frontend to backend microservices.
11. `client/src/App.jsx`: Renders the main dashboard interface for interacting with the agent.
12. `setup.sh`: Automates the installation of dependencies and environment initialization.

